            <div class="text-size-medium is-text-red">Visa Application Process with IMIN2UK<br></div>
            <div class="spacer-large"></div>
            <div class="process-grid">
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">01.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Initial Free Consultation<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">For first-time enquiries, we assess your current circumstances and
                    requirements, then advise on the most suitable visa options and typical costs.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">02.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Service Information<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">Once you decide to proceed with Imin2UK, we provide a tailored document
                    checklist for your chosen visa category along with a detailed cost invoice.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">03.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Application &amp; Submission<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">As soon as we receive your required documents, service fee, and any
                    applicable costs, we submit your application to the Home Office without delay.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">04.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Online and Visa Centre Procedures<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">You may need to pay the Home Office fee online yourself, or attend a UK
                    Visa Application Centre to register your biometrics (fingerprints, etc.).<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">05.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Confirmation &amp; Updates<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">Once your application is submitted to the Home Office, Imin2UK provides
                    you with regular progress updates in a timely manner.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-row">
                <div class="process-column-l">
                  <div class="process-numbers">06.</div>
                  <div><strong class="process-sub-heading">Visa Approval &amp; Arrival<br></strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column-r">
                  <div class="text-size-medium">When your visa is granted, usually in the form of an eVisa, you will be
                    guided on how to use your Share Code. You can then begin the life you’ve planned.<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
